AvgEntryPrice.example:
Vars: Gain(0);
If MarketPosition = 0 Then Buy Next Bar At Market;
If MarketPosition = 1 Then Gain = Close - AvgEntryPrice;

Crosses.example:
Vars: Fast(0), Slow(0);
Fast = Average(Close, 5);
Slow = Average(Close, 20);
If Fast crosses above Slow Then Buy Next Bar At Market;

